            { label: '60% Bitcoin / 30% Ethereum / 10% stablecoin yield (USDC on Aave)', consequence: 'Excellent diversification within crypto. Bitcoin for store of value, Ethereum for smart contract ecosystem exposure, and a stablecoin earning 4-6% yield provides a balanced approach across the three major crypto use cases. This mirrors how institutional crypto portfolios are constructed.', score: 3 },
            { label: '100% in a trending altcoin your TikTok feed is promoting', consequence: 'Over 95% of altcoins go to zero. Meme coins and TikTok recommendations are the crypto equivalent of penny stock pump-and-dumps. Without real technology, revenue, or users, these tokens are pure speculation. This approach is how the majority of crypto investors lose everything.', score: 0 }
