            { label: 'Take out a loan to buy more Bitcoin, it\'s "on sale"', consequence: 'Using leverage or borrowed money to buy a volatile asset in free-fall is extremely dangerous. You could be forced to sell at the bottom if you can\'t make loan payments. The 5% allocation rule exists precisely so you never feel compelled to take reckless actions during crashes.', score: 0 }
