      'Allocating 5% to crypto, diversifying across BTC/ETH/stablecoins, and holding through the crash with continued DCA, scoring 9/9.',
      'Crypto can be a powerful portfolio enhancer when treated with discipline: small allocation (1-10%), diversified across proven assets (BTC + ETH), self-custodied on hardware wallets, and dollar-cost averaged over time. The investors who get rich in crypto are not the ones who YOLO at the top, they\'re the ones who size positions correctly, DCA consistently, and hold through the inevitable 70%+ crashes without flinching. Strategy beats speculation every time.'
