            { label: '100% PE buyout, it\'s safer and more predictable', consequence: 'PE buyout is indeed more predictable, but you miss the asymmetric upside of VC. Endowments with perpetual time horizons are the ideal VC investors, they can tolerate the J-curve and wait for power-law winners. A 0% VC allocation leaves significant return potential on the table.', score: 1 }
