      'Alternative Investments Capstone',
      'You\'ve now learned about every major alternative asset class: real estate, private equity, hedge funds, commodities, crypto, collectibles, infrastructure, and farmland. Together, these alternatives represent a $13+ trillion market that the world\'s most sophisticated investors, Yale ($41.4B endowment), Brookfield ($900B), Ray Dalio ($150B), and Bill Gates (269,000 acres), have used to build generational wealth.',
      'This capstone will test everything you\'ve learned across 9 lessons. You\'ll face complex multi-asset scenarios requiring you to apply knowledge from every alternative category, build complete portfolio strategies from scratch, and prove you can think like an institutional allocator.',
