          explanation: 'You\'ve just completed 10 lessons that put you ahead of 99% of retail investors and many financial advisors in alternative investment knowledge. The democratization of alternatives through ETFs and fractional platforms is removing access barriers. The only remaining barrier is knowledge, which you now have.'
